Review F4: a CLOSED 90-degree sector of radius 20 -- two radii and the arc
999
between them. The solid built from it has area (90/360)*pi*20^2; if the
999
sweep went the other way it would be the 270-degree sector, three times
999
larger. That is how the sweep direction becomes measurable geometry
999
rather than a boolean anyone can assert.
